   }
  ],
  "answer": "E",
  "acceptedAnswers": null,
  "answerUnit": null,
  "solutions": [
   {
    "title": "Factor out 13",
    "body": "$1313.13 = 13 \\times 101.01$ and $0.13 = 13 \\times 0.01$. So\n\n$$\\frac{1313.13}{0.13} = \\frac{101.01}{0.01} = 10101.$$\n\n**Answer: (E) 10101**"
   },
   {
    "title": "Remove the decimals",
    "body": "Multiply both numbers by 100: $\\frac{131313}{13} = 10101$ (since $13 \\times 10101 = 131313$).\n\n**Answer: (E) 10101**"
   }
  ],
